{"obsah":"<p>When everyone on the team is on holiday, Martin keeps riding. An indestructible rider who, even on the threshold of 50, manages several exhibitions a week plus rides in the bike park or on the trails around Česká Lípa – and on top of that he's a multiple national and world champion. This time Martin stood in for the guys, who were on a well-deserved holiday, at the local children's day in Milovice and in Struhařov – close to traditional Trial and MTB spots. </p>\n\n<p>A few photos from Struhařov have just arrived, so take a look at how Martin still jumps.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160445.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160445.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211680\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160433_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160433_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211681\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_154231.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_154231.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211679\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160117_1.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F09%2FIMG_20220828_160117_1.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-211682\"/></a></figure>\n</figure>"}